WEBVTT

00:10:23.174 --> 00:10:35.938
(Applause)

00:10:35.938 --> 00:10:39.615
Thank you.

00:10:39.615 --> 00:10:43.836
But you learn lessons from these things that happen to you.

00:10:43.836 --> 00:10:46.054
I learned to be always there.

00:10:46.054 --> 00:10:48.292
The first thing, I got out of jail,

00:10:48.292 --> 00:10:51.612
of course after I took a shower, I went online,

00:10:51.612 --> 00:10:54.831
I opened my Twitter account and my Facebook page,

00:10:54.831 --> 00:10:57.119
and I've been always very respectful

00:10:57.119 --> 00:10:58.626
to those people who are opining to me.

00:10:58.626 --> 00:11:00.226
I would listen to what they say,